    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a proposal for a new high-density apartment complex in a residential area. i need to prep for a town hall meeting with the locals. can you give me a summary of the main arguments or criticisms people usually have against high-density zoning and new developments like this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
